{
  "slug": "agent-recall",
  "name": "Agent Recall",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Persistent memory for AI coding agents. SQLite knowledge graph with scoped entities, MCP tools, and LLM-summarized briefings.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Hooks** (2): `SessionStart`, `PostToolUse`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `.mcp.json`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install agent-recall@claude-community` from `mnardit/agent-recall`.\n\nPersistent memory for AI coding agents. Your agent forgets everything between sessions — names, decisions, preferences, context. agent-recall fixes this.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "hook": 2,
    "mcp": 1
  },
